UID:scar-osc-2026-8419a72c6953fc8bd7c9@codex.local
DTSTAMP:20260806T095215Z
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Oslo:20260808T083000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Oslo:20260808T100000
SUMMARY:Changes in Circumpolar Antarctic Gradients in Ecosystems (C-CAGE)
LOCATION:Room Hyde Park B\, Clarion Hotel The Hub\, Biskop Gunnerus’ gate
  3\, 0155 Oslo\, Norway
DESCRIPTION:Business meeting for the SCAR Programme Planning Group\, led by
  Huw Griffiths\, Cath Waller and Anton Van de Putte. Learn about C-CAGE an
 d how to contribute. C-CAGE uses natural Antarctic and sub-Antarctic envir
 onmental gradients to improve predictions of ecological change and support
  biodiversity management and conservation.\n\nEvent page: https://scar2026
 .org/schedule/changes-in-circumpolar-antarctic-gradients-in-ecosystems-c-c
 age\n\nMap: https://maps.app.goo.gl/AE9fRE3XantQaxmj9\n\nTimes are local t
 o Oslo (Europe/Oslo).
URL:https://scar2026.org/schedule/changes-in-circumpolar-antarctic-gradient
 s-in-ecosystems-c-cage
CATEGORIES:SCAR OSC 2026
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
